  - Before (base): RED human report emits four unsafe controls and two injected lines from a real POSIX workspace path
  - After (head): GREEN report emits 0 unsafe controls and 0 injected lines; all three real CLI processes exit 0
- Readback (subprocess,config-file,disk): captured child stdout/stderr/exit plus config-file bytes and fs.stat of the path read back from JSON
